SUMMARY:AMIA 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:American Medical Informatics Association Annual Symposium\nStat
 us: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://web.archive.
 org/web/20261001143649/https://amia.org/education-events/amia-2026-annual
 -symposium\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#amia-2026
 \nNotes: amia.org blocks automated access\, so its pages were read via In
 ternet Archive captures (May-Oct 2026). They confirm Nov 7-11\, 2026 at t
 he Hilton Anatole\, Dallas. The single submission portal gave one deadlin
 e for all nine types\, Tuesday March 10\, 2026 at 11:59 p.m. EDT (capture
 s Jan 20-Mar 7\, 2026)\, and now says closed. No capture from Mar 10 to A
 pr 16 shows whether it was extended (2025 moved from Mar 19 to Mar 25). P
 apers appear in the proceedings archived in PMC\; podium abstracts and po
 sters are not MEDLINE-indexed. Panels\, debates\, demos\, tutorials and w
 orkshops are not tracked as routes. AMIA cites 2\,300+ attendees for Dall
 as. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Healthcare & Clinical AI,Data Mining & Data Science,Human-AI Int
 eraction & Deployment
URL:https://web.archive.org/web/20261001143649/https://amia.org/education-e
 vents/amia-2026-annual-symposium
LOCATION:Dallas\, Texas\, USA
